 Why: `#Replayable` code must replay from explicit inputs; ambient time, randomness, network, or console IO would make the same replay diverge
 Fix: Inject a deterministic clock/RNG or mockable input, pass recorded data in, or move the ambient effect outside the replayable function
 Denial: replayable
 Call chain: replay_turn
